Check out these 3 spots in London which all specialise in selling just 1 thing… which means they HAVE to get it right? 👀

In my opinion… they have all absolutely smashed it:

@arancino_ofsicily - be sure to try the spinach and cheese one, it’s SO cheesy 🥹
@lamaritxulondon - I’ve had a burnt basque cheesecake from a spot in San Sebastián where this dish originated… and this London version is so close to the original. Well worth a visit! 🍰
@cheekyscone - and it doesn’t get more British than this little spot in Notting Hill… I loved their biscoff one… also, their cheese scone is SO good but sells out so quickly so get down early 🙏🏻

