If you’re near Tottenham Court Road, don’t miss ThaiCup, the first authentic Thai tea shop in London! We enjoyed the classic Thai Milk Tea and Thai Milk Green Tea with tapioca—both were fantastic, especially the Thai Milk Tea. For dessert, the Pandan coconut sundae with green jelly was delightfully coconuty, and the mango sticky rice with condensed milk was a favorite. We also tried the ABC shaved ice, though the sweetcorn topping wasn’t for me. Overall, a truly authentic spot! 
