A strong September of eats around London 🍽️ includes press invites

@dreameryldn // Finally made it to this gorgeous ice cream shop x wine bar to see out the last of summer — the bittersweet orange flavour was a fave.

@holycarrotrestaurant // A clever, vegetable-focused menu bringing the fun with fire and fermentation — the smoked carrots are the one to order.

@potterandreid // Forever a favourite when I’m around Spitalfields — a relaxed neighbourhood café slinging fab sandos and @allpressespressouk coffee.

@aromebakerylondon // Early mornings in the city = a mandatory honey butter toast stop. 

@laganalondon // From the team behind @bottargalondon, this new spot delivers the same vibey atmosphere, plus that beloved cheesecake, now in a decadent caramel flavour.

@hoko.london // On my list for far too long, and well worth the wait. A bustling Hong Kong–inspired café with flavour-packed dishes and the most indulgent Hong Kong French toast.

